# The generated output of the four targets is committed on purpose: reading it is the point of
# this project, so a reviewer should see what the engine produces without having to run it.
# `npm run verify` regenerates it and fails if what is committed drifts from what the engine emits.
#
# The `--no-idioms` trees are a comparison the verification builds, not an artifact anyone reads,
# and the interpreter and build caches are not ours.
out/*-plain/
out/**/__pycache__/
out/**/.ruff_cache/
out/**/target/
node_modules

# Cargo build artifacts from the benchmark harness, the same as the generated crate above.
bench/rust/target/
